        "toEmail": "REPLACE_WITH_APPROVER_EMAIL",
        "subject": "=Funding review: {{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.title }} \u2014 {{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.alignment_score }}/100",
        "message": "<h3>Funding opportunity \u2014 review before sign-off</h3>\n<p><b>What this is:</b> {{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.summary }}</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\">\n<tr><td><b>Funder</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.funder }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Amount</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.amount }} {{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.currency }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Deadline</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.deadline }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Mission alignment</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.mission_alignment }} ({{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.mission_score }}/100)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Overall score</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.alignment_score }}/100</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Effort</b></td><td>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.effort_estimate }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Why it aligns with AIRI \u2014 reasons to approve:</b></p>\n<ul>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.approval_reasons.map(r => '<li>'+r+'</li>').join('') || '<li>No specific reasons generated</li>' }}</ul>\n<p><b>Watch-outs to weigh before saying yes:</b></p>\n<ul>{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.watch_outs.concat($('Parse Evaluation').item.json.values_conflicts).map(w => '<li>'+w+'</li>').join('') || '<li>None flagged</li>' }}</ul>\n<p><a href=\"{{ $('Parse Evaluation').item.json.url }}\">View the full opportunity</a></p>\n<p>Knowing the above, the decision is simply: <b>do we want to pursue this?</b></p>",
        "responseType": "approval",
        "options": {
          "limitWaitTime": {
            "values": {
              "resumeAmount": 7,
              "resumeUnit": "days"
            }
          }
        }
      },
